{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21562","headline":"赠吕三校书 · 元稹","name":"赠吕三校书","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"同年同拜校书郎，触处潜行烂熳狂。\n共占花园争赵辟，竞添钱贯定秋娘。\n七年浮世皆经眼，八月闲宵忽竝牀。\n语到欲明欢又泣，傍人相笑两相伤。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"元稹","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_21562.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21562","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}